Current Head: {HEAD_NAME}
Heir Apparent: {HEIR_NAME}

Royalists back the rightful dynasty, not merely the sitting ruler. High mood can make them swear fealty to the reigning clan; at -60 mood or worse they may denounce a weak king, and under a usurper they can rally to restore their chosen house.

Demand revocation of the {TITLE_NAME} from the {HOLDER_CLAN}. Cost: {INFLUENCE_COST} influence.

Requires direct de facto liege authority and a weak or strong claim. If the vassal refuses, the dispute immediately becomes a private feud war.

Likely response: {RESPONSE}

{STATUS}

